# Futures

Source: https://api.unusualwhales.com/docs/openapi.yaml; retrieved 2026-09-24T01:21:27.462441+00:00

Full descriptions, inherited security, effective parameters, responses and schemas. No live calls.

## GET /api/futures/contracts

Futures Contracts

Active CME futures contracts with trading activity over the last `days` CME sessions (default 3, max 30),
most active first. Available on the Advanced API tier, or with the `futures` add-on — contact oskar@unusualwhales.com, enterprise@unusualwhales.com or nastja.petrovic@unusualwhales.com for access.


### Fully resolved operation
```json
