## GET /api/futures/flow

Futures Flow

Newest-first trade prints across ALL contracts, block trades included by default.
Each row carries `is_block` and `is_spread`. Optional server-side filters narrow the feed.
Available on the Advanced API tier, or with the `futures` add-on — contact oskar@unusualwhales.com, enterprise@unusualwhales.com or nastja.petrovic@unusualwhales.com for access.


### Fully resolved operation
